# D27 companion of seq_es10: one starformation_and_feedback call at the sequence's final substep
# (step 9 of effective_steps 10), with the full carried-value record.
# Input: the oracle-generated state entering that substep, obtained by chaining oracle_c05 single
# calls for substeps 0 .. 8 from seq_es10.in (each call's recorded end state, bit for bit, is the
# next call's input); every other field as in seq_es10.in. Its end state equals seq_es10.out's.
# Provenance of the starting state, from seq_es10.in:
# Every substep of one stable central with effective_steps 10: each bin sampled once.
# Constructed input (not R0 output); every value is set explicitly. All flags and parameters are
# R0's unless a line says NOT R0.
format sage26-oracle-fixture 1
routine starformation_and_feedback

